# Three launches through the box's ^T worktree picker — fix/rate-limits (finishes unread once the
# cursor has moved on), feat/auth-tokens (stops on a permission prompt), main (left running) — then
# a terminal in main, and ^q back to the cards with the cursor on its card. An F12 (unbound, 0.6 s)
# after each launch lets it settle; the run of them at the end lets the pull request lookups and
# the delayed finish land.
